7804536c42ee4807c1089694b624952363e10b989a94b51","download_count":230,"created_at":"2026-10-24T21:02:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T21:03:03Z"},{"id":673305359,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4oIdMP","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":72,"digest":"sha256:2693a43c3ce555e5bdc6deca29377d2b62db15d6ee79c938451bf23e6358f894","download_count":23,"created_at":"2026-10-24T21:02:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T21:02:47Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **The command is now `gloom`.** `gloomberb` keeps working as an alias, and an update adds the new name by itself. (#2136)\n- **Set order prices from the chart.** With the order ticket beside a chart, click a price or drag an order's line, then review and confirm in the ticket. (#2147)\n- **Open straight into your layout.** Desktop and web draw your panes right away instead of a loading screen, and the desktop starts about 1.4 s sooner. (#2149)\n- **Crypto ETF flows.** The new `ETFF` function shows daily flows into spot bitcoin and ether funds, and search finds spot crypto ETFs. (#2046)\n- **Earnings at a glance.** `CALLS` puts the next call on top with its start time, and `ERN` shows the week as a calendar of logos with an alert when results are out. (#2084, #2092, #2115)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Charts: resize, maximize and fold panels, and zoom each value axis with a drag or a pinch. (#2098, #2076)\n- `HIRE`: Moves, Expansion and Anomalies tabs. (#2118, #2132, #2176)\n- Alerts on implied volatility and on any economic release, plus a log of fired alerts. (#2124, #2203)\n- Logos beside company names and flags beside countries. (#2089, #2094)\n- A message about one row shows on that row in Brokers, Orders, Team and Alerts. (#2085, #2178)\n- Linux: starts on Alpine and when the temp folder cannot run the render library. (#2154, #2206)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.18.3...v0.18.4)\n"}
